Keyboard Companion firmware (K10 HE battery over raw HID)
=========================================================

This repository contains modifications to QMK Firmware that add a custom
raw-HID battery channel (command 0xA4) and a wireless "push" model for the
Keychron K10 HE.

It is a derivative work of QMK Firmware and is therefore distributed under the
GNU General Public License, version 2 (see the LICENSE file).

